{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-method","title":"Founding Method","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/founding-method","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-socratic-method","title":"苏格拉底方法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/founding-method/the-socratic-method","wordCount":1851,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"definition-and-concept","title":"定义与概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/core-contributions/founding-method/definition-and-concept","wordCount":1796,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现苏格拉底对哲学方法的奠基性贡献。他创立了以问答、诘问、对话为核心的\"苏格拉底方法\"，确立了通过理性辨析追求真理的传统；他对普遍定义与概念本质的不懈追求，孕育了西方逻辑学与形而上学的萌芽。本章揭示苏格拉底方法的精神内核及其对哲学、逻辑与教育的深远影响。\n"}